<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle steady/firm - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle steady/firm - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers</p>
<p>were steady-firm. Trade moderately active. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: High Select and Choice 2-3 1200-1400 lbs</p>
<p>64.50-66.50.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: High Select and Choice 2-3 1025-1150 lbs</p>
<p>64.00-66.00.</p>
